# Copy to .env and fill in.
#
# POINTSYEAH_ID_TOKEN: a JWT idToken from a logged-in pointsyeah.com session.
# Without it, the API returns synthetic/teaser data only. To grab one:
#   1. Log in at https://www.pointsyeah.com
#   2. Open DevTools → Application → Local Storage
#   3. Find the key ending in `.idToken` (under the firebase auth user) and copy the value
#
# The token typically expires in ~1 hour. The CLI will warn if it's expired.
POINTSYEAH_ID_TOKEN=
